# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Blinding secrets — nothing in this directory is committed.
#
# The root .gitignore excludes salt.txt. That is necessary but not sufficient: unblind_map.json is
# the same secret in materialized form. Publishing either one lets any reader — or any future agent
# working in this repo — recover condition_label from blinded_label, which makes the blind
# decorative (seam/blinding.py). Analysis is required to consume blinded_label only, and that
# requirement is only enforceable while the mapping stays out of the history.
#
# This lives here rather than in the root .gitignore so the rule travels with the directory it
# protects and cannot be lost to an unrelated edit upstream.
#
# Back this directory up out of band. A lost salt cannot be regenerated: a new one would orphan
# every blinded_label already emitted.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*
!.gitignore
